<title>UK: Rheinische Hypo sets 1.0 billion mark 5-year bond.</title>
<headline>Rheinische Hypo sets 1.0 billion mark 5-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by</p>
<p>joint lead managers Commerzbank, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell,</p>
<p>Dresdner Kleinwort Benson and DG Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RHEINISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.75	MATURITY    17.JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.25     PAY DATE    17.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.25	LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 1	   MGT/UND    0.6	 SELL CONC   0.19</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 726</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
